  "note": "Triennial election of the Portstewart Urban District Council, polled 18 May 1949. Sixteen candidates stood for twelve seats. The Belfast News-Letter prints the result; nine of the twelve elected represented the Ratepayers’ Association, and the outgoing chairman, Mr. S. S. Henry, and former chairman Mr. R. Millar were defeated."
